# Vercel
.vercel

# Local data: everything in data/ is the owner's (the ledger, statement PDFs, decision
# files, household facts, tax documents, backups, logs, the demo instance) and is never
# committed. Ignored wholesale so a new store added later is private from day one; only
# the empty-folder placeholders are tracked.
/data/*
!/data/.gitkeep
!/data/backups/
/data/backups/*
!/data/backups/.gitkeep

# Claude Code's local state (worktrees, machine-specific settings)
/.claude/

# The render audit's shard results (RENDER_AUDIT_OUT in CI)
/render-audit-*.json
